B.NS=new A.e5("\xf0\u0178\x8f\xa2","Office Parks & Estates","Multi-tenant environments where security coverage is shared and response coordination matters.")
B.NV=new A.e5("\xf0\u0178\x8f\xab","Schools & Universities","Protecting staff and students with rapid, informed response when every second counts.")
